        <key>roleRationale</key>
        <string>Place top on the genuine SC flat mark frame with native optical X transferred along its actual italic axis. Retain the native deep below point and explicitly share it with ogonek below the complete lower feature. Set middle on actual body ink at half SC frame and side on actual upper-right ink. The new rounded cap has its separate SC overshoot; native default zero roles remain active and unchanged in defaults.</string>
